# Remake: SQAuto — Full Dockerization, Supabase Connection & CI/CD

Complete re-architecture of SQAuto to be production-ready from day 1. We fix the root cause of the old server dying — it was running `next dev` and `uvicorn --reload` in Docker (heavy dev-mode processes on a small VM). We replace them with a proper production build pipeline.

