## What Was Wrong Before

| Problem | Root Cause | Fix |
|---|---|---|
| 502 Bad Gateway | `next dev` running in prod — consumed all RAM | Build Next.js; run `next start` |
| SSH timeout | OOM hung the entire server | Standalone Next.js output is ~50MB vs 500MB+ |
| Build hangs | Docker re-installs all npm deps on every deploy | Use pre-built Docker Hub images |
| Fragile Nginx | Manual script, not idempotent | Config file in repo, managed by Nginx container |

---

## Architecture (New)

```
GitHub Push → GitHub Actions:
   • Builds Docker images (api, web, worker)
   • Pushes to Docker Hub
   • SSHes into VM → docker compose pull && docker compose up -d

VM Layout:
   [Nginx container :80/:443] → [Web container :3000]
                              → [API container :8000]
   [Redis container :6379] ← [Worker container]
   All services → Supabase (external)
```

---

## Proposed Changes

### 1. Docker — Production Builds

#### [MODIFY] [Dockerfile](file:///home/eisen/Downloads/SQAuto/docker/Dockerfile)
Complete rewrite. Key changes:
- `web` stage: add `RUN npm run build` to compile Next.js, use `next start` not `next dev`
- Use Next.js **standalone output** mode to reduce image size from ~800MB to ~150MB
- Add `.dockerignore` to prevent `node_modules`, `.next`, `__pycache__` from being sent to build context (this was causing the slow builds)
- `api` stage: use `gunicorn` wrapping `uvicorn` for proper multi-worker production serving

#### [MODIFY] [docker-compose.yml](file:///home/eisen/Downloads/SQAuto/docker/docker-compose.yml)
- Pull pre-built images from Docker Hub (no more building on the VM!)
- Add `nginx` service using official image with our config mounted
- Add `restart: unless-stopped` to all services
- Add memory limits to protect VM stability
- Add `uploads` named volume for file persistence

#### [NEW] docker/nginx.conf
- Production Nginx config inside repo; handles `/api/` → API, `/` → web
- Handles large SQL file uploads with `client_max_body_size 2g`
- Proper proxy headers and timeouts

#### [NEW] .dockerignore
- Exclude `node_modules/`, `.next/`, `__pycache__/`, `uploads/`, `.env`, `.git`

