### 2. Next.js — Standalone Build Mode

#### [MODIFY] [next.config.js](file:///home/eisen/Downloads/SQAuto/apps/web/next.config.js)
- Add `output: 'standalone'` — this tells Next.js to bundle only the files needed to run the server, producing a ~150MB image instead of ~800MB

